Independent / clean-room provenance
-----------------------------------
Mellow is an independently created program. It was built from observed device
behavior only. It contains no Oura source code, no decompiled binaries, no
firmware, and no captured proprietary data. The Bluetooth protocol knowledge was
derived solely by observing the author's own ring's traffic on the author's own
hardware. Mellow is intended to achieve interoperability of an independently
created program with a device the user owns (17 U.S.C. § 1201(f)).

No keys, captures, or vendor data are distributed with this software. The 16-byte
provisioning key is generated and controlled by the user, not extracted from Oura.

